<h3>My Array</h3>
<p id="a07e67e4-5a02-4b59-ae4c-1c6ef8035771" class=""><strong>Exercise</strong>: Create some objects using the same model you created on the MyObjects page. Populate three more of them with three more books from the 10 Books Exercise. Put each of the objects in its own index in an Array and dump it out. Are you starting to see how an array of objects can be a powerful thing? If not, no stress but stay tuned. I know that this exercise is repetitive. In a few screens we are going to see how we can make the computer create the objects and arrays we want more easily and automatically. For now though, just type it out.</p>

<bx:output >

